#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:public_institution.blog_post_4
msgid ""
"<b>7:00 PM – Plaza Doors &amp; Food Trucks Open:</b> Taste local delicacies "
"from seven independent regional food trucks parked along the promenade."
msgstr ""
"<b>19:00 – ເປີດປະຕູລານກວ້າງ &amp; ລົດຂາຍອາຫານ:</b> ລອງຊີມອາຫານທ້ອງຖິ່ນແຊບໆ ຈາກລົດຂາຍອາ"
"ຫານ 7 ຄັນ ທີ່ຈອດລຽບຕາມທາງຍ່າງ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:public_institution.blog_post_4
msgid ""
"<b>8:00 PM – Live Music:</b> The local folk band <i>The Wandering Strings</"
"i> takes the main wood terrace stage to play an acoustic outdoor set."
msgstr ""
"<b>20:00 – ດົນຕີສົດ:</b> ວົງດົນຕີພື້ນເມືອງ <i>The Wandering Strings</i> ຂຶ້ນສະແດງເທິງເວທີໄ"
"ມ້ຫຼັກ ເພື່ອຫຼິ້ນດົນຕີອາຄູສຕິກກາງແຈ້ງ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:public_institution.blog_post_4
msgid ""
"<b>9:30 PM – The Main Event:</b> Grab your blankets! A spectacular, "
"synchronized pyrotechnic display will light up the sky directly above the "
"modern architecture of City Hall."
msgstr ""
"<b>21:30 – ງານຫຼັກ:</b> ຕຽມຜ້າຫົ່ມຂອງທ່ານໃຫ້ພ້ອມ! ການສະແດງດອກໄມ້ໄຟອັນຕື່ນຕາຕື່ນໃຈ ທີ່ສອດປະສານ"
"ກັນ ຈະສ່ອງແສງສະຫວ່າງທົ່ວທ້ອງຟ້າ ເໜືອຕຶກເທດສະບານເມືອງອັນທັນສະໄໝ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:public_institution.blog_post_1
msgid ""
"<b>Access infrastructure:</b> A budget of €340,000 was approved to construct "
"a low-impact permeable roadway, complete with dedicated bicycle lanes and "
"underground smart utility lines."
msgstr ""
"<b>ໂຄງລ່າງພື້ນຖານເສັ້ນທາງ:</b> ງົບປະມານ 340,000 ເອີໂຣ ໄດ້ຮັບການອະນຸມັດ ເພື່ອກໍ່ສ້າງຖະໜົນທີ່ນ້ຳຊຶມຜ່"
"ານໄດ້ ແລະ ຫຼຸດຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ສິ່ງແວດລ້ອມ, ພ້ອມດ້ວຍເສັ້ນທາງລົດຖີບສະເພາະ ແລະ ລະບົບສາທາລະນູປະໂພກອັດສະລິຍ"
"ະໃຕ້ດິນ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Accounting:</b> Manage the municipal budget, automate vendor payments, "
"and produce standardized public\n"
"                financial reports."
msgstr ""
"<b>ການບັນຊີ:</b> ຄຸ້ມຄອງງົບປະມານເທດສະບານ, ຊຳລະເງິນໃຫ້ຜູ້ສະໜອງແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ແລະ ສ້າງບົດລາຍ"
"ງານການເງິນ\n"
"                ສາທາລະນະທີ່ໄດ້ມາດຕະຖານ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Action Items:</b> If a decision requires action (e.g., \"Repair the park "
"fence\"), the task is assigned to\n"
"                a staff member with a specific deadline."
msgstr ""
"<b>ລາຍການທີ່ຕ້ອງປະຕິບັດ:</b> ຖ້າການຕົກລົງຮຽກຮ້ອງໃຫ້ມີການລົງມືເຮັດ (ເຊັ່ນ: \"ສ້ອມແປງຮົ້ວສວນສາທາລະ"
"ນະ\"), ວຽກດັ່ງກ່າວຈະຖືກມອບໝາຍໃຫ້\n"
"                ພະນັກງານພ້ອມກຳນົດເວລາທີ່ຊັດເຈນ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Activity Tracking:</b> Managers use internal notes and scheduled "
"activities within the ticket to ensure\n"
"                deadlines for public safety issues are met."
msgstr ""
"<b>ການຕິດຕາມການເຄື່ອນໄຫວ:</b> ຜູ້ຈັດການໃຊ້ບັນທຶກພາຍໃນ ແລະ ກິດຈະກຳທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນໃບແຈ້ງເລື່ອງ ເພື່ອ"
"ຮັບປະກັນວ່າ\n"
"                ບັນຫາຄວາມປອດໄພສາທາລະນະໄດ້ຮັບການແກ້ໄຂທັນຕາມກຳນົດ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Appointment Types:</b> Configure specific durations for different needs, "
"such as \"ID Renewal (15 mins)\"\n"
"                or \"Urban Planning Consultation (45 mins).\""
msgstr ""
"<b>ປະເພດການນັດໝາຍ:</b> ກຳນົດໄລຍະເວລາສະເພາະສຳລັບຄວາມຕ້ອງການຕ່າງໆ ເຊັ່ນ \"ຕໍ່ອາຍຸບັດປະຈຳຕົ"
"ວ (15 ນາທີ)\"\n"
"                ຫຼື \"ປຶກສາຫາລືການວາງຜັງເມືອງ (45 ນາທີ).\""

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Appointments:</b> Provides a 24/7 self-service portal for citizens to "
"book meetings with officials or\n"
"                schedule document renewals."
msgstr ""
"<b>ການນັດໝາຍ:</b> ລະບົບປະຕູອອນລາຍບໍລິການຕົນເອງຕະຫຼອດ 24/7 ສຳລັບປະຊາຊົນ ເພື່ອນັດພົບເຈົ້າໜ້າທີ່ "
"ຫຼື\n"
"                ກຳນົດເວລາມາຕໍ່ອາຍຸເອກະສານ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:event.event,description:public_institution.event_event_3
msgid ""
"<b>Arrival:</b> The plaza opens at 7:00 PM for food and music; fireworks "
"begin promptly at 9:30 PM."
msgstr ""
"<b>ການມາຮອດ:</b> ລານກວ້າງເປີດເວລາ 19:00 ເພື່ອບໍລິການອາຫານ ແລະ ດົນຕີ; ສ່ວນດອກໄມ້ໄຟຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້"
"ນກົງເວລາ 21:30."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:event.event,description:public_institution.event_event_2
msgid ""
"<b>Audience:</b> All registered municipal voters. First-time voters are "
"especially encouraged to attend!"
msgstr ""
"<b>ກຸ່ມເປົ້າໝາຍ:</b> ຜູ້ມີສິດປ່ອນບັດເລືອກຕັ້ງທີ່ລົງທະບຽນທຸກຄົນ. ຂໍເຊີນຊວນຜູ້ມີສິດປ່ອນບັດຄັ້ງທຳອິດເປັນພິເສດ!"

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:event.event,description:public_institution.event_event_1
msgid ""
"<b>Audience:</b> Engaged residents, local business owners, and anyone "
"curious about municipal governance."
msgstr ""
"<b>ກຸ່ມເປົ້າໝາຍ:</b> ປະຊາຊົນທີ່ສົນໃຈ, ເຈົ້າຂອງທຸລະກິດທ້ອງຖິ່ນ, ແລະ ຜູ້ທີ່ຕ້ອງການຮຽນຮູ້ກ່ຽວກັບການຄຸ້ມຄອງ"
"ເທດສະບານ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:event.event,description:public_institution.event_event_3
msgid ""
"<b>Audience:</b> Open to everyone! Families, children, and residents of all "
"ages."
msgstr ""
"<b>ກຸ່ມເປົ້າໝາຍ:</b> ເປີດກວ້າງສຳລັບທຸກຄົນ! ຄອບຄົວ, ເດັກນ້ອຍ, ແລະ ປະຊາຊົນທຸກເກນອາຍຸ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Automatic Archiving:</b> Once fully signed, the document is automatically "
"stored in the\n"
"                <b>Documents</b> app and visible in the <b>Citizen Portal</"
"b>."
msgstr ""
"<b>ການຈັດເກັບອັດຕະໂນມັດ:</b> ເມື່ອເຊັນຄົບຖ້ວນແລ້ວ, ເອກະສານຈະຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນ\n"
"                ແອັບ <b>ເອກະສານ (Documents)</b> ແລະ ສາມາດເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້ໃນ <b>ປະຕູສຳລັບ"
"ປະຊາຊົນ (Citizen Portal)</b>."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Blog posts:</b> Publish official statements on municipal projects, "
"emergency alerts (like weather\n"
"                warnings), or highlights from community events."
msgstr ""
"<b>ໂພສບລັອກ:</b> ເຜີຍແຜ່ຖະແຫຼງການທາງການກ່ຽວກັບໂຄງການຂອງເທດສະບານ, ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນສຸກເສີນ (ເ"
"ຊັ່ນ: ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ\n"
"                ສະພາບອາກາດ), ຫຼື ຈຸດເດັ່ນຂອງກິດຈະກຳຊຸມຊົນ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Blog:</b> Publishes official news, emergency alerts, and community "
"stories to keep the public\n"
"                well-informed."
msgstr ""
"<b>ບລັອກ:</b> ເຜີຍແຜ່ຂ່າວສານທາງການ, ແຈ້ງເຕືອນເຫດສຸກເສີນ, ແລະ ເລື່ອງລາວໃນຊຸມຊົນ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ປະຊາຊົ"
"ນ\n"
"                ຮັບຮູ້ຂໍ້ມູນຂ່າວສານຢ່າງທົ່ວເຖິງ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:public_institution.product_product_5_product_template
msgid ""
"<b>Capacity:</b> 180 seated guests / 250 standing for cocktail receptions."
msgstr ""
"<b>ຄວາມຈຸ:</b> ນັ່ງໄດ້ 180 ບ່ອນນັ່ງ / ຢືນໄດ້ 250 ຄົນ ສຳລັບງານລ້ຽງຄັອກເທວ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:public_institution.product_product_6_product_template
msgid "<b>Capacity:</b> 350+ people (Flexible open-air layout)."
msgstr "<b>ຄວາມຈຸ:</b> 350+ ຄົນ (ຮູບແບບກາງແຈ້ງທີ່ປັບປ່ຽນໄດ້)."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:public_institution.product_product_4_product_template
msgid "<b>Capacity:</b> Up to 30 people (Boardroom or Classroom style)"
msgstr "<b>ຄວາມຈຸ:</b> ສູງສຸດ 30 ຄົນ (ຮູບແບບຫ້ອງປະຊຸມ ຫຼື ຫ້ອງຮຽນ)"

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Centralize Communication:</b> Discourage staff from using personal emails "
"for official business. All\n"
"                communication should happen inside the <b>Odoo Chatter</b> "
"to ensure continuity if a staff member is absent."
msgstr ""
"<b>ລວມສູນການສື່ສານ:</b> ຫຼີກລ່ຽງບໍ່ໃຫ້ພະນັກງານໃຊ້ອີເມວສ່ວນຕົວສຳລັບວຽກງານທາງການ. ທຸກໆ\n"
"                ການສື່ສານຄວນດຳເນີນພາຍໃນ <b>Odoo Chatter</b> ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນຄວາມຕໍ່ເນື່ອງຂອ"
"ງວຽກ ເມື່ອມີພະນັກງານຂາດວຽກ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Chatter &amp; Notifications:</b> As the ticket status changes from \"In "
"Progress\" to \"Resolved,\" the citizen\n"
"                receives automated email updates, building trust in public "
"services."
msgstr ""
"<b>ລະບົບສົນທະນາ &amp; ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ:</b> ເມື່ອສະຖານະຂອງໃບແຈ້ງເລື່ອງປ່ຽນຈາກ \"ກຳລັງດຳເນີນກາ"
"ນ\" ເປັນ \"ແກ້ໄຂແລ້ວ,\" ປະຊາຊົນ\n"
"                ຈະໄດ້ຮັບອີເມວແຈ້ງເຕືອນອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ສ້າງຄວາມເຊື່ອໝັ້ນຕໍ່ການບໍລິການສາທາລະນະ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:public_institution.blog_post_1
msgid ""
"<b>Citizen action item:</b> We believe transparent governance requires "
"active collaboration. The Council invites all direct neighbors to review the "
"infrastructure timelines and voice any environmental inquiries."
msgstr ""
"<b>ສິ່ງທີ່ປະຊາຊົນມີສ່ວນຮ່ວມ:</b> ພວກເຮົາເຊື່ອວ່າການຄຸ້ມຄອງທີ່ໂປ່ງໃສຮຽກຮ້ອງໃຫ້ມີການຮ່ວມມືຢ່າງຕັ້ງໜ້າ. ສະ"
"ພາຂໍເຊີນຊວນປະຊາຊົນໃກ້ຄຽງທຸກຄົນ ກວດກາກຳນົດເວລາໂຄງລ່າງພື້ນຖານ ແລະ ສອບຖາມຂໍ້ສົງໄສດ້ານສິ່ງແວດລ້ອມ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Communication History:</b> The portal tracks all official messages "
"exchanged with the city hall, creating\n"
"                a reliable audit trail for both parties."
msgstr ""
"<b>ປະຫວັດການສື່ສານ:</b> ລະບົບປະຕູຕິດຕາມທຸກຂໍ້ຄວາມທາງການທີ່ຕິດຕໍ່ກັບເທດສະບານ, ເຊິ່ງສ້າງ\n"
"                ຫຼັກຖານການກວດສອບທີ່ເຊື່ອຖືໄດ້ສຳລັບທັງສອງຝ່າຍ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:public_institution.blog_post_3
msgid "<b>Community Culture &amp; Safety</b>"
msgstr "<b>ວັດທະນະທຳຊຸມຊົນ &amp; ຄວາມປອດໄພ</b>"

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Conflict Management:</b> The system ensures that no two community groups "
"can book the same town hall or\n"
"                tennis court at the same time."
msgstr ""
"<b>ການຈັດການການຈອງຊ້ອນ:</b> ລະບົບຮັບປະກັນວ່າຈະບໍ່ມີກຸ່ມຊຸມຊົນສອງກຸ່ມ ຈອງຫ້ອງປະຊຸມໃຫຍ່ ຫຼື\n"
"                ເດີ່ນເທັນນິດດຽວກັນ ໃນເວລາຊ້ອນກັນໄດ້."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:event.event,description:public_institution.event_event_2
msgid ""
"<b>Details:</b> Polling is open from 9:00 AM to 5:00 PM. High-visibility "
"signage and \"Civic Ambassadors\" will be on-site to help guide you through "
"the process. Let's make our turnout the highest yet!"
msgstr ""
"<b>ລາຍລະອຽດ:</b> ໜ່ວຍປ່ອນບັດເປີດແຕ່ 9:00 ຫາ 17:00. ມີປ້າຍຊີ້ບອກຊັດເຈນ ແລະ ຕົວແທນອາສາສະໝັກ"
"ຄອຍຊ່ວຍແນະນຳທ່ານໃນທຸກຂັ້ນຕອນ. ມາຮ່ວມກັນສ້າງສະຖິຕິການມາໃຊ້ສິດໃຫ້ສູງສຸດ!"

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:event.event,description:public_institution.event_event_3
msgid ""
"<b>Details:</b> We’ll have local food trucks and live music on the terrace. "
"Bring your own picnic blankets or lawn chairs. For the safety of all, please "
"leave pets at home as the display can be loud."
msgstr ""
"<b>ລາຍລະອຽດ:</b> ພວກເຮົາມີລົດຂາຍອາຫານທ້ອງຖິ່ນ ແລະ ດົນຕີສົດຢູ່ລະບຽງ. ສາມາດນຳຜ້າປູນັ່ງຫຼິ້ນ ຫຼື ຕັ່ງສ"
"ະໜາມມາເອງໄດ້. ເພື່ອຄວາມປອດໄພຂອງທຸກຄົນ, ກະລຸນາປະສັດລ້ຽງໄວ້ຢູ່ເຮືອນ ເນື່ອງຈາກສຽງດອກໄມ້ໄຟຂ້ອນຂ້າງ"
"ດັງ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:public_institution.blog_post_3
msgid "<b>Digital Transformation</b>"
msgstr "<b>ການຫັນປ່ຽນສູ່ລະບົບດິຈິຕອນ</b>"

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Document Access:</b> All signed permits, tax documents, or rental "
"agreements are stored securely and\n"
"                remain accessible for download at any time."
msgstr ""
"<b>ການເຂົ້າເຖິງເອກະສານ:</b> ໃບອະນຸຍາດທີ່ເຊັນແລ້ວ, ເອກະສານອາກອນ, ຫຼື ສັນຍາເຊົ່າທັງໝົດ ຖືກເກັບຮັກ"
"ສາຢ່າງປອດໄພ ແລະ\n"
"                ສາມາດດາວໂຫຼດໄດ້ທຸກເວລາ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Document Templates:</b> Store standard forms for building permits, "
"parking stickers, or community\n"
"                petitions as reusable digital templates."
msgstr ""
"<b>ແບບຟອມເອກະສານ:</b> ເກັບຮັກສາແບບຟອມມາດຕະຖານສຳລັບໃບອະນຸຍາດກໍ່ສ້າງ, ສະຕິກເກີຈອດລົດ, ຫຼື ຄ"
"ຳຮ້ອງທຸກ\n"
"                ຂອງຊຸມຊົນ ເປັນແບບຟອມດິຈິຕອນທີ່ນຳກັບມາໃຊ້ໃໝ່ໄດ້."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:public_institution.blog_post_1
msgid ""
"<b>Eco-friendly guidelines:</b> The Council mandated that all new homes "
"built within this perimeter must adhere to modern bioclimatic standards, "
"utilizing sustainable timber framing and rainwater harvesting systems."
msgstr ""
"<b>ແນວທາງທີ່ເປັນມິດກັບສິ່ງແວດລ້ອມ:</b> ສະພາກຳນົດໃຫ້ເຮືອນສ້າງໃໝ່ທັງໝົດໃນຂອບເຂດນີ້ ຕ້ອງປະຕິບັດຕາມມາ"
"ດຕະຖານອາຄານທີ່ສອດຄ່ອງກັບສະພາບອາກາດ, ນຳໃຊ້ໂຄງສ້າງໄມ້ແບບຍືນຍົງ ແລະ ລະບົບເກັບກັກນ້ຳຝົນ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Employees:</b> Maintain a secure directory of city hall staff, tracking "
"their certifications, training,\n"
"                and departmental assignments."
msgstr ""
"<b>ພະນັກງານ:</b> ຄຸ້ມຄອງຖານຂໍ້ມູນພະນັກງານເທດສະບານຢ່າງປອດໄພ, ຕິດຕາມໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ, ການຝຶກອົບຮົມ,\n"
"                ແລະ ການມອບໝາຍວຽກຕາມພະແນກ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:event.event,description:public_institution.event_event_3
msgid ""
"<b>Entry:</b> Free of charge (please register via the \"Get Tickets\" button "
"to help us manage capacity)."
msgstr ""
"<b>ຄ່າເຂົ້າຮ່ວມ:</b> ຟຣີ (ກະລຸນາລົງທະບຽນຜ່ານປຸ່ມ \"ຮັບປີ້\" ເພື່ອຊ່ວຍພວກເຮົາຈັດສັນຈຳນວນຄົນ)."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Events Management:</b> Create pages for the annual summer fair or town "
"hall meetings. Citizens can\n"
"                register for free or paid tickets, allowing you to track "
"expected attendance."
msgstr ""
"<b>ການຈັດການງານກິດຈະກຳ:</b> ສ້າງໜ້າເວັບສຳລັບງານບຸນລະດູຮ້ອນປະຈຳປີ ຫຼື ກອງປະຊຸມເທດສະບານ. ປະຊ"
"າຊົນສາມາດ\n"
"                ລົງທະບຽນຮັບປີ້ຟຣີ ຫຼື ຊື້ປີ້, ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຕິດຕາມຈຳນວນຜູ້ເຂົ້າຮ່ວມໄດ້."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Events:</b> Organizes, promotes, and tracks attendance for local fairs, "
"town halls, and community\n"
"                workshops."
msgstr ""
"<b>ງານກິດຈະກຳ:</b> ຈັດຕັ້ງ, ປະຊາສຳພັນ, ແລະ ຕິດຕາມການເຂົ້າຮ່ວມງານບຸນທ້ອງຖິ່ນ, ກອງປະຊຸມເທດສະບ"
"ານ, ແລະ ກອງປະຊຸມ\n"
"                ສຳມະນາຊຸມຊົນ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:public_institution.blog_post_2
msgid "<b>Fairplay Avenue:</b> 18%"
msgstr "<b>ຖະໜົນ ແຟຣເພລ (Fairplay Avenue):</b> 18%"

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:public_institution.blog_post_6
msgid ""
"<b>Flawless Acoustics:</b> The venue boasts hidden acoustic ceiling panels, "
"ensuring that whether a string quartet or a live folk band is playing on the "
"raised wooden stage, the sound is crisp, warm, and clear."
msgstr ""
"<b>ລະບົບສຽງທີ່ສົມບູນແບບ:</b> ສະຖານທີ່ມີແຜງເພດານຊັບສຽງແບບເຊື່ອງ, ຮັບປະກັນວ່າບໍ່ວ່າຈະເປັນວົງດົນຕີສາຍ"
"ສີ່ສາຍ ຫຼື ວົງດົນຕີພື້ນເມືອງສົດທີ່ຫຼິ້ນເທິງເວທີໄມ້, ສຽງຈະມີຄວາມຄົມຊັດ, ອົບອຸ່ນ, ແລະ ແຈ່ມແຈ້ງ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:public_institution.blog_post_6
msgid ""
"<b>Flexible Layouts:</b> From a seated dinner banquet for 180 guests to an "
"elegant standing cocktail reception for 250, our facility managers customize "
"the floor plan to fit your exact creative vision."
msgstr ""
"<b>ຜັງຫ້ອງທີ່ປັບປ່ຽນໄດ້:</b> ຕັ້ງແຕ່ງານລ້ຽງອາຫານຄ່ຳແບບນັ່ງໂຕະ 180 ທ່ານ ຈົນຮອດງານລ້ຽງຄັອກເທວແບບຢື"
"ນສຸດຫຼູ 250 ທ່ານ, ຜູ້ຈັດການສະຖານທີ່ຂອງພວກເຮົາພ້ອມປັບແຕ່ງຜັງພື້ນທີ່ຕາມທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:public_institution.blog_post_2
msgid "<b>Founder’s Lane:</b> 12%"
msgstr "<b>ຮ່ອມ ຜູ້ກໍ່ຕັ້ງ (Founder’s Lane):</b> 12%"

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:public_institution.blog_post_3
msgid "<b>Green Infrastructure</b>"
msgstr "<b>ໂຄງລ່າງພື້ນຖານສີຂຽວ</b>"

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Helpdesk Integration:</b> Citizens can view the live status of their "
"submitted tickets (e.g., \"Pothole\n"
"                repair scheduled for Tuesday\") without having to call the "
"front desk."
msgstr ""
"<b>ການເຊື່ອມໂຍງໜ່ວຍຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ:</b> ປະຊາຊົນສາມາດເບິ່ງສະຖານະຕົວຈິງຂອງເລື່ອງທີ່ແຈ້ງເຂົ້າມາ (ເຊັ່ນ: "
"\"ກຳນົດສ້ອມແປງ\n"
"                ຂຸມຖະໜົນໃນວັນອັງຄານ\") ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງໂທຫາຫ້ອງການ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Helpdesk:</b> The submission automatically generates a ticket. Staff can "
"categorize the request by\n"
"                department and assign it to the relevant maintenance team."
msgstr ""
"<b>ໜ່ວຍຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ:</b> ການສົ່ງເລື່ອງຈະສ້າງໃບແຈ້ງເລື່ອງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ພະນັກງານສາມາດຈັດໝວດໝູ່ຄຳຮ້ອງ"
"ຕາມ\n"
"                ພະແນກ ແລະ ມອບໝາຍໃຫ້ທີມງານສ້ອມແປງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Helpdesk:</b> Tracks citizen inquiries, pothole reports, and complaints "
"from initial submission through\n"
"                to final administrative resolution."
msgstr ""
"<b>ໜ່ວຍຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ:</b> ຕິດຕາມການສອບຖາມຂອງປະຊາຊົນ, ການລາຍງານຂຸມທາງ, ແລະ ຂໍ້ຮ້ອງທຸກ ຕັ້ງແຕ່ເລີ່ມ"
"ຍື່ນເລື່ອງ\n"
"                ຈົນເຖິງຂັ້ນຕອນການແກ້ໄຂຂັ້ນສຸດທ້າຍ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:public_institution.product_product_4_product_template
msgid ""
"<b>Ideal For:</b> Board meetings, strategic planning sessions, HOA/POA "
"assemblies, educational workshops, and small-scale seminars."
msgstr ""
"<b>ເໝາະສຳລັບ:</b> ກອງປະຊຸມຄະນະກຳມະການ, ກອງປະຊຸມວາງແຜນຍຸດທະສາດ, ກອງປະຊຸມສະມາຄົມເຈົ້າຂອ"
"ງເຮືອນ, ກອງປະຊຸມສຳມະນາດ້ານການສຶກສາ, ແລະ ສຳມະນາຂະໜາດນ້ອຍ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:public_institution.product_product_6_product_template
msgid ""
"<b>Ideal For:</b> School garden fétes, fundraiser lotteries, farmers' "
"markets, outdoor concerts, yoga in the park, and community family days."
msgstr ""
"<b>ເໝາະສຳລັບ:</b> ງານບຸນສວນໂຮງຮຽນ, ການຈັບສະຫຼາກລະດົມທຶນ, ຕະຫຼາດນັດກະສິກຳ, ຄອນເສີດກາງແຈ້"
"ງ, ໂຍຄະໃນສວນ, ແລະ ວັນຄອບຄົວຊຸມຊົນ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:public_institution.product_product_5_product_template
msgid ""
"<b>Ideal For:</b> Weddings, community banquets, corporate award ceremonies, "
"cultural performances, and non-profit fundraisers."
msgstr ""
"<b>ເໝາະສຳລັບ:</b> ງານດອງ, ງານລ້ຽງຊຸມຊົນ, ພິທີມອບລາງວັນອົງກອນ, ການສະແດງສິລະປະວັດທະນະທຳ, "
"ແລະ ການລະດົມທຶນຂອງອົງການບໍ່ຫວັງຜົນກຳໄລ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Internal Approvals:</b> Use the same tool for the Mayor or Council to "
"sign off on budgets and official\n"
"                decrees without passing physical folders around the office."
msgstr ""
"<b>ການອະນຸມັດພາຍໃນ:</b> ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືດຽວກັນເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຈົ້າຄອງນະຄອນ ຫຼື ສະພາ ເຊັນອະນຸມັດງົບປະມານ ແລ"
"ະ ລັດຖະດຳລັດ\n"
"                ທາງການ ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງສົ່ງແຟ້ມເອກະສານໄປມາໃນຫ້ອງການ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Invoicing:</b> For paid rentals, Odoo generates an invoice automatically, "
"which can be paid online via\n"
"                the citizen portal using integrated payment providers."
msgstr ""
"<b>ການອອກໃບແຈ້ງໜີ້:</b> ສຳລັບການເຊົ່າທີ່ມີຄ່າໃຊ້ຈ່າຍ, Odoo ຈະສ້າງໃບແຈ້ງໜີ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ເຊິ່ງສາມ"
"າດຈ່າຍອອນລາຍຜ່ານ\n"
"                ປະຕູສຳລັບປະຊາຊົນ ໂດຍໃຊ້ລະບົບຮັບຊຳລະເງິນທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄວ້."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:public_institution.product_product_4_product_template
msgid ""
"<b>Key Features:</b> Integrated AV system with 4K display, high-speed "
"municipal Wi-Fi, climate control, and ergonomic seating."
msgstr ""
"<b>ຈຸດເດັ່ນຫຼັກ:</b> ລະບົບພາບ ແລະ ສຽງໃນຕົວພ້ອມຈໍ 4K, Wi-Fi ເທດສະບານຄວາມໄວສູງ, ລະບົບປັບອາກ"
"າດ, ແລະ ຕັ່ງນັ່ງສະດວກສະບາຍຕາມຫຼັກສະລິລະສາດ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:public_institution.product_product_6_product_template
msgid ""
"<b>Key Features:</b> Outdoor power outlets for PA systems, accessible paved "
"pathways, night-time bistro lighting, and integrated bench seating."
msgstr ""
"<b>ຈຸດເດັ່ນຫຼັກ:</b> ປັກສຽບໄຟຟ້າກາງແຈ້ງສຳລັບເຄື່ອງສຽງ, ທາງຍ່າງປູພື້ນທີ່ສະດວກສະບາຍ, ໄຟປະດັບຍາມກາ"
"ງຄືນ, ແລະ ມ້ານັ່ງຍາວໃນຕົວ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:public_institution.product_product_5_product_template
msgid ""
"<b>Key Features:</b> Professional acoustic treatment, dedicated stage area "
"for bands or speakers, adjustable ambient lighting, and direct access to a "
"commercial-grade catering prep kitchen."
msgstr ""
"<b>ຈຸດເດັ່ນຫຼັກ:</b> ການຕົກແຕ່ງລະບົບສຽງແບບມືອາຊີບ, ເວທີສະເພາະສຳລັບວົງດົນຕີ ຫຼື ຜູ້ເວົ້າ, ໄຟປັບບັນຍາກ"
"າດໄດ້, ແລະ ທາງເຂົ້າໂດຍກົງສູ່ຫ້ອງຄົວຕຽມອາຫານມາດຕະຖານການຄ້າ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:event.event,description:public_institution.event_event_1
msgid ""
"<b>Location:</b> City Hall Meeting Room (Second Floor) or join via the live "
"stream link in your Citizen Portal."
msgstr ""
"<b>ສະຖານທີ່:</b> ຫ້ອງປະຊຸມເທດສະບານ (ຊັ້ນສອງ) ຫຼື ເຂົ້າຮ່ວມຜ່ານລິ້ງຖ່າຍທອດສົດໃນປະຕູສຳລັບປະຊາຊົນຂອ"
"ງທ່ານ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Marketing &amp; Newsletter:</b> Use the registered emails from events and "
"surveys to send official monthly\n"
"                city newsletters via the <b>Email Marketing</b> app."
msgstr ""
"<b>ການຕະຫຼາດ &amp; ຈົດໝາຍຂ່າວ:</b> ໃຊ້ອີເມວທີ່ລົງທະບຽນຈາກງານກິດຈະກຳ ແລະ ການສຳຫຼວດ ເພື່ອສົ່ງ"
"ຈົດໝາຍຂ່າວ\n"
"                ປະຈຳເດືອນຂອງເມືອງ ຜ່ານແອັບ <b>ການຕະຫຼາດຜ່ານອີເມວ (Email Marketing)</"
"b>."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:public_institution.blog_post_2
msgid "<b>Meadowview Drive:</b> 28%"
msgstr "<b>ຖະໜົນ ມິດໂດວິວ (Meadowview Drive):</b> 28%"

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Meeting Minutes:</b> Use the task description or the <b>Notes</b> app to "
"record the debate and the final\n"
"                vote for each item during the session."
msgstr ""
"<b>ບົດບັນທຶກກອງປະຊຸມ:</b> ໃຊ້ລາຍລະອຽດໜ້າວຽກ ຫຼື ແອັບ <b>ບັນທຶກ (Notes)</b> ເພື່ອບັນທຶກການອະພິ"
"ປາຍ ແລະ ຜົນການລົງຄະແນນສຽງ\n"
"                ຂັ້ນສຸດທ້າຍສຳລັບແຕ່ລະວາລະໃນລະຫວ່າງກອງປະຊຸມ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:event.event,description:public_institution.event_event_1
#: model_terms:event.event,description:public_institution.event_event_2
#: model_terms:event.event,description:public_institution.event_event_3
msgid "<b>Modalities:</b>"
msgstr "<b>ເງື່ອນໄຂ ແລະ ຮູບແບບ:</b>"

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Odoo Sign:</b> Send a signature request via email. The citizen signs on "
"their smartphone or computer, and\n"
"                the system records the IP address and timestamp for legal "
"validity."
msgstr ""
"<b>Odoo Sign:</b> ສົ່ງຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍລາຍເຊັນຜ່ານອີເມວ. ປະຊາຊົນເຊັນຜ່ານສະມາດໂຟນ ຫຼື ຄອມພິວເຕີ, ແລ"
"ະ\n"
"                ລະບົບຈະບັນທຶກທີ່ຢູ່ IP ພ້ອມເວລາ ເພື່ອຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຕາມກົດໝາຍ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:public_institution.blog_post_2
msgid "<b>Olympia Way:</b> 42% (The Winning Choice!)"
msgstr "<b>ຖະໜົນ ໂອລິມເປຍ (Olympia Way):</b> 42% (ຊະນະການເລືອກຕັ້ງ!)"

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Online Booking:</b> Citizens choose their preferred date and time from "
"the website, receiving an instant\n"
"                confirmation and a calendar invite."
msgstr ""
"<b>ການຈອງອອນລາຍ:</b> ປະຊາຊົນເລືອກວັນ ແລະ ເວລາທີ່ຕ້ອງການຜ່ານເວັບໄຊ, ພ້ອມຮັບການຢືນຢັນ\n"
"                ແລະ ໜັງສືເຊີນເຂົ້າປະຕິທິນໃນທັນທີ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Payroll:</b> Ensure compliant and timely salary processing for all public "
"servants, from the central\n"
"                administration to the public works crew."
msgstr ""
"<b>ເງິນເດືອນ:</b> ຮັບປະກັນການຄິດໄລ່ເງິນເດືອນໃຫ້ຖືກຕ້ອງຕາມລະບຽບ ແລະ ທັນເວລາສຳລັບພະນັກງານລັດທຸກ"
"ຄົນ, ຕັ້ງແຕ່\n"
"                ພະແນກບໍລິຫານສູນກາງ ຈົນຮອດທີມງານໂຍທາທິການ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:event.event,description:public_institution.event_event_2
msgid ""
"<b>Process:</b> Check-in at the front desk, then choose your preferred "
"voting method (private paper booth or digital kiosk)."
msgstr ""
"<b>ຂັ້ນຕອນ:</b> ລົງທະບຽນຢູ່ໂຕະຕ້ອນຮັບ, ຈາກນັ້ນເລືອກຮູບແບບການປ່ອນບັດທີ່ຕ້ອງການ (ຕູ້ປ່ອນບັດເຈ້ຍແບບສ່ວ"
"ນຕົວ ຫຼື ຕູ້ດິຈິຕອນ)."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Project Management:</b> Create a project for \"City Council 2024.\" Each "
"agenda item for an upcoming\n"
"                meeting is entered as a task."
msgstr ""
"<b>ການຄຸ້ມຄອງໂຄງການ:</b> ສ້າງໂຄງການສຳລັບ \"ສະພາເທດສະບານ 2024\". ແຕ່ລະວາລະສຳລັບກອງປະ"
"ຊຸມ\n"
"                ທີ່ຈະມາເຖິງຈະຖືກປ້ອນເຂົ້າເປັນໜ້າວຽກ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Project Visibility:</b> Selected city projects can be shared in the "
"portal to show the community the\n"
"                progress of major infrastructure works."
msgstr ""
"<b>ຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສຂອງໂຄງການ:</b> ໂຄງການຕ່າງໆຂອງເມືອງສາມາດແບ່ງປັນລົງໃນລະບົບປະຕູ ເພື່ອສະແດງໃຫ້ຊຸ"
"ມຊົນເຫັນ\n"
"                ຄວາມຄືບໜ້າຂອງວຽກງານໂຄງລ່າງພື້ນຖານທີ່ສຳຄັນ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Project:</b> Structures council agendas and tracks administrative tasks "
"to ensure accountability across\n"
"                all municipal departments."
msgstr ""
"<b>ໂຄງການ:</b> ຈັດໂຄງສ້າງວາລະກອງປະຊຸມສະພາ ແລະ ຕິດຕາມໜ້າວຽກບໍລິຫານ ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນຄວາມຮັບຜິດຊ"
"ອບ\n"
"                ໃນທຸກໆພະແນກການຂອງເທດສະບານ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:event.event,description:public_institution.event_event_1
msgid ""
"<b>Public Comment:</b> The first 30 minutes are dedicated to \"Floor Time\" "
"where residents can speak for 3 minutes on any agenda item."
msgstr ""
"<b>ຄຳຄິດເຫັນສາທາລະນະ:</b> 30 ນາທີທຳອິດແມ່ນ \"ເວລາເປີດໂອກາດ\" ເຊິ່ງປະຊາຊົນສາມາດປະກອບຄຳຄິ"
"ດເຫັນໄດ້ 3 ນາທີ ສຳລັບທຸກວາລະກອງປະຊຸມ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Public Surveys:</b> Use the <b>Survey</b> app to poll residents on new "
"projects (e.g., \"What should be\n"
"                the priority for the new park?\")."
msgstr ""
"<b>ການສຳຫຼວດຄວາມຄິດເຫັນ:</b> ໃຊ້ແອັບ <b>ການສຳຫຼວດ (Survey)</b> ເພື່ອສຳຫຼວດປະຊາຊົນກ່ຽວກັບໂ"
"ຄງການໃໝ່ໆ (ເຊັ່ນ: \"ສິ່ງໃດຄວນເປັນ\n"
"                ບຸລິມະສິດສຳລັບສວນສາທາລະນະໃໝ່?\")."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:public_institution.blog_post_3
msgid "<b>Public Works &amp; Roads</b>"
msgstr "<b>ໂຍທາທິການ &amp; ເສັ້ນທາງ</b>"

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:public_institution.blog_post_1
msgid ""
"<b>Public consultation:</b> The official public inquiry phase is now open. "
"Residents can review the full scale-model architectural blueprints on "
"display in the City Hall lobby."
msgstr ""
"<b>ການຮັບຟັງຄວາມຄິດເຫັນຂອງປະຊາຊົນ:</b> ໄລຍະການເປີດຮັບຟັງຄວາມຄິດເຫັນຢ່າງເປັນທາງການໄດ້ເລີ່ມຂຶ້ນແ"
"ລ້ວ. ປະຊາຊົນສາມາດເຂົ້າເບິ່ງແບບແປນສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳຈຳລອງຂະໜາດເຕັມ ທີ່ວາງສະແດງຢູ່ຫ້ອງໂຖງເທດສະບາ"
"ນ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid "<b>Ready to transform your community management?</b>"
msgstr "<b>ພ້ອມແລ້ວບໍ່ທີ່ຈະຍົກລະດັບການຄຸ້ມຄອງຊຸມຊົນຂອງທ່ານ?</b>"

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Reminders:</b> Automated SMS or email reminders are sent 24 hours before "
"the meeting, significantly\n"
"                reducing missed appointments."
msgstr ""
"<b>ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ:</b> ລະບົບຈະສົ່ງ SMS ຫຼື ອີເມວແຈ້ງເຕືອນອັດຕະໂນມັດກ່ອນຮອດເວລານັດ 24 ຊົ່ວໂມງ, ເ"
"ຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດຜ່ອນ\n"
"                ການພາດນັດໝາຍໄດ້ຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Rental Agreement:</b> Link the booking to <b>Odoo Sign</b> to ensure the "
"citizen accepts the terms of use\n"
"                and liability before the reservation is confirmed."
msgstr ""
"<b>ສັນຍາການເຊົ່າ:</b> ເຊື່ອມໂຍງການຈອງເຂົ້າກັບ <b>Odoo Sign</b> ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນວ່າປະຊາຊົນຍອມຮັບ"
"ເງື່ອນໄຂການນຳໃຊ້\n"
"                ແລະ ຄວາມຮັບຜິດຊອບ ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະຢືນຢັນການຈອງ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Rental:</b> Manages the availability and payment for community halls, "
"sports fields, and public\n"
"                equipment."
msgstr ""
"<b>ການເຊົ່າ:</b> ຄຸ້ມຄອງສະຖານະວ່າງ ແລະ ການຊຳລະເງິນສຳລັບຫ້ອງປະຊຸມຊຸມຊົນ, ເດີ່ນກິລາ, ແລະ ອຸປະກ"
"ອນ\n"
"                ສາທາລະນະ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:event.event,description:public_institution.event_event_2
msgid ""
"<b>Requirements:</b> Please bring a valid photo ID and your voter "
"registration card (digital or physical)."
msgstr ""
"<b>ສິ່ງທີ່ຕ້ອງຕຽມມາ:</b> ກະລຸນານຳບັດປະຈຳຕົວທີ່ມີຮູບຖ່າຍທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ໝົດອາຍຸ ແລະ ບັດປະຈຳຕົວຜູ້ມີສິດເລືອກຕັ້ງ (ແ"
"ບບດິຈິຕອນ ຫຼື ແບບເຈ້ຍ) ມານຳ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Resource Catalog:</b> List all available assets on the website with high-"
"quality photos, capacity limits,\n"
"                and clear pricing rules."
msgstr ""
"<b>ລາຍການຊັບພະຍາກອນ:</b> ສະແດງຊັບສິນທີ່ມີທັງໝົດເທິງເວັບໄຊ ພ້ອມຮູບພາບຄຸນນະພາບສູງ, ຈຳນວນຄວາມ"
"ຈຸ,\n"
"                ແລະ ລາຄາທີ່ຊັດເຈນ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Results Transparency:</b> Share the anonymized results of community polls "
"on the website to show how\n"
"                public opinion influenced a final decision."
msgstr ""
"<b>ຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສຂອງຜົນການສຳຫຼວດ:</b> ເປີດເຜີຍຜົນການສຳຫຼວດຄວາມຄິດເຫັນຂອງຊຸມຊົນແບບບໍ່ລະບຸຕົວຕົນເທິງ"
"ເວັບໄຊ ເພື່ອສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນວ່າ\n"
"                ສຽງຂອງປະຊາຊົນມີຜົນຕໍ່ການຕັດສິນໃຈແນວໃດ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:public_institution.blog_post_6
msgid ""
"<b>Seamless Catering Integration:</b> The hall features direct, hidden "
"service access to a commercial-grade preparation kitchen, allowing your "
"chosen catering team to serve guests seamlessly without disrupting the "
"aesthetics of the room."
msgstr ""
"<b>ການບໍລິການອາຫານທີ່ສະດວກສະບາຍ:</b> ຫ້ອງປະຊຸມມີທາງເຂົ້າອອກສຳລັບພະນັກງານທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂດຍກົງກັບຫ້ອງ"
"ຄົວຕຽມອາຫານ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ທີມງານບໍລິການອາຫານສາມາດເສີບແຂກໄດ້ຢ່າງຄ່ອງແຄ້ວ ໂດຍບໍ່ລົບກວນບັນຍາກາດພາຍໃນງ"
"ານ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Searchable archives:</b> Residents can easily find past announcements "
"regarding tax changes, zoning laws,\n"
"                or historical meeting minutes."
msgstr ""
"<b>ຄັງເກັບເອກະສານທີ່ຄົ້ນຫາໄດ້:</b> ປະຊາຊົນສາມາດຄົ້ນຫາປະກາດເກົ່າກ່ຽວກັບການປ່ຽນແປງອາກອນ, ກົດໝາຍ"
"ຜັງເມືອງ,\n"
"                ຫຼື ບົດບັນທຶກກອງປະຊຸມຍ້ອນຫຼັງໄດ້ຢ່າງງ່າຍດາຍ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Sign:</b> Facilitates legal digital signatures for permits, petitions, "
"and internal approvals,\n"
"                eliminating the need for physical paperwork."
msgstr ""
"<b>ເຊັນ (Sign):</b> ອຳນວຍຄວາມສະດວກໃນການເຊັນດິຈິຕອນທີ່ມີຜົນທາງກົດໝາຍ ສຳລັບໃບອະນຸຍາດ, ຄຳຮ້ອ"
"ງຮຽນ, ແລະ ການອະນຸມັດພາຍໃນ,\n"
"                ໂດຍບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ເຈ້ຍເອກະສານອີກຕໍ່ໄປ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Social sharing:</b> Link your blog posts to social media channels to "
"ensure the message reaches residents\n"
"                wherever they are online."
msgstr ""
"<b>ການແບ່ງປັນສູ່ສື່ສັງຄົມ:</b> ເຊື່ອມໂຍງບົດຄວາມບລັອກຂອງທ່ານໄປຍັງສື່ສັງຄົມອອນລາຍຕ່າງໆ ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນວ່າ"
"ຂໍ້ມູນຈະເຂົ້າເຖິງປະຊາຊົນ\n"
"                ໃນທຸກຊ່ອງທາງອອນລາຍ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Staff Calendar:</b> The official's Odoo calendar is automatically "
"updated, preventing double-bookings and\n"
"                allowing for better preparation."
msgstr ""
"<b>ປະຕິທິນພະນັກງານ:</b> ປະຕິທິນ Odoo ຂອງເຈົ້າໜ້າທີ່ຈະອັບເດດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ປ້ອງກັນການນັດຊ້ອນກັນ "
"ແລະ\n"
"                ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຕຽມຄວາມພ້ອມໄດ້ດີຂຶ້ນ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Standardize Your Templates:</b> Build clean templates for your most "
"common permits in <b>Odoo Sign</b>.\n"
"                This ensures legal consistency and professional municipal "
"branding."
msgstr ""
"<b>ສ້າງແບບຟອມມາດຕະຖານ:</b> ສ້າງແບບຟອມທີ່ເປັນລະບຽບຮຽບຮ້ອຍສຳລັບໃບອະນຸຍາດທີ່ໃຊ້ເລື້ອຍໆໃນ <b>"
"Odoo Sign</b>.\n"
"                ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍຮັບປະກັນຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຕາມກົດໝາຍ ແລະ ຄວາມເປັນມືອາຊີບຂອງເທດສະບານ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:public_institution.product_product_6_product_template
msgid "<b>Surface Area:</b> 1,200 m² (13,000 sq. ft.)"
msgstr "<b>ເນື້ອທີ່:</b> 1,200 ຕຣ.ມ (13,000 ຕຣ.ຟ)"

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:public_institution.product_product_5_product_template
msgid "<b>Surface Area:</b> 280 m² (3,000 sq. ft.)"
msgstr "<b>ເນື້ອທີ່:</b> 280 ຕຣ.ມ (3,000 ຕຣ.ຟ)"

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:public_institution.product_product_4_product_template
msgid "<b>Surface Area:</b> 65 m² (700 sq. ft.)"
msgstr "<b>ເນື້ອທີ່:</b> 65 ຕຣ.ມ (700 ຕຣ.ຟ)"

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Survey:</b> Gathers community feedback on public initiatives, urban "
"planning, and local service\n"
"                satisfaction."
msgstr ""
"<b>ການສຳຫຼວດ:</b> ຮວບຮວມຄຳຄິດເຫັນຂອງຊຸມຊົນກ່ຽວກັບແຜນງານສາທາລະນະ, ການວາງຜັງເມືອງ, ແລະ ຄ"
"ວາມເພິ່ງພໍໃຈ\n"
"                ຕໍ່ການບໍລິການທ້ອງຖິ່ນ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:event.event,description:public_institution.event_event_1
msgid ""
"<b>The Details:</b> The full agenda is available for download on the "
"<b>Citizen Portal</b> 48 hours before the meeting. Come early to grab a "
"coffee and meet your representatives informally before the session begins."
msgstr ""
"<b>ລາຍລະອຽດ:</b> ສາມາດດາວໂຫຼດວາລະກອງປະຊຸມເຕັມໄດ້ທີ່ <b>ປະຕູສຳລັບປະຊາຊົນ (Citizen "
"Portal)</b> 48 ຊົ່ວໂມງກ່ອນເລີ່ມກອງປະຊຸມ. ເຊີນມາຮອດກ່ອນເວລາເພື່ອດື່ມກາເຟ ແລະ ພົບປະກັບຕົວແທນຂອ"
"ງທ່ານແບບເປັນກັນເອງກ່ອນກອງປະຊຸມເລີ່ມ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>The Portal-First Strategy:</b> Encourage citizens to use the portal for "
"all requests. This reduces phone\n"
"                interruptions and creates a permanent record of all "
"interactions."
msgstr ""
"<b>ຍຸດທະສາດເນັ້ນການໃຊ້ລະບົບປະຕູອອນລາຍ:</b> ຊຸກຍູ້ໃຫ້ປະຊາຊົນໃຊ້ລະບົບປະຕູອອນລາຍສຳລັບທຸກໆຄຳຮ້ອງ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດຜ່ອນ\n"
"                ສາຍໂທລົບກວນ ແລະ ສ້າງບັນທຶກປະຫວັດການຕິດຕໍ່ທັງໝົດໄວ້ຢ່າງຖາວອນ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Timeline View:</b> Use the Gantt or Kanban views to see how many council "
"directives are currently being\n"
"                processed by the administration."
msgstr ""
"<b>ມຸມມອງເສັ້ນເວລາ:</b> ໃຊ້ມຸມມອງ Gantt ຫຼື Kanban ເພື່ອຕິດຕາມເບິ່ງວ່າມີຄຳສັ່ງຂອງສະພາຈຳນວນເທົ່າ"
"ໃດທີ່ກຳລັງ\n"
"                ດຳເນີນການໂດຍຝ່າຍບໍລິຫານ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
