#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:public_institution.blog_post_1
msgid ""
"During our monthly public session on May 12th, 2026, the City Council "
"officially voted to approve the structural zoning amendment for the <b>Pine "
"Creek District</b>. This critical milestone clears the path for a modern, "
"eco-responsible residential extension located immediately adjacent to our "
"Municipal Sports Field."
msgstr ""
"ໃນລະຫວ່າງກອງປະຊຸມປະຈຳເດືອນເມື່ອວັນທີ 12 ພຶດສະພາ 2026, ສະພາເທດສະບານໄດ້ລົງມະຕິເຫັນດີຮັບຮອງການ"
"ປັບປຸງຜັງເມືອງສຳລັບ <b>ເຂດ ພາຍຄຣີກ (Pine Creek District)</b>. ບາດກ້າວສຳຄັນນີ້ເປີດທາງໃຫ້ແກ່"
"ການຂະຫຍາຍເຂດທີ່ຢູ່ອາໄສທີ່ທັນສະໄໝ ແລະ ໃສ່ໃຈສິ່ງແວດລ້ອມ ເຊິ່ງຕັ້ງຢູ່ຕິດກັບເດີ່ນກິລາເທດສະບານ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.homepage
