#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:public_institution.product_product_4_product_template
msgid ""
"Elevate your next gathering in our state-of-the-art meeting room. Designed "
"with productivity and natural light in mind, this space offers a seamless "
"blend of modern architecture and functional design."
msgstr ""
"ຍົກລະດັບງານປະຊຸມຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປຂອງທ່ານໃນຫ້ອງປະຊຸມທີ່ທັນສະໄໝ. ຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບການເຮັດວຽກ ພ້"
"ອມຮັບແສງທຳມະຊາດ, ສະຖານທີ່ແຫ່ງນີ້ຜະສົມຜະສານສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳຮ່ວມສະໄໝ ແລະ ປະໂຫຍດໃຊ້ສອຍໄດ້ຢ່າງລົງ"
"ຕົວ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Eliminate waiting room congestion by allowing citizens to book fixed time "
"slots for specialized services or meetings\n"
"        with local leaders."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼຸດຜ່ອນຄວາມແອອັດໃນຫ້ອງລໍຖ້າ ໂດຍເປີດໃຫ້ປະຊາຊົນຈອງຊ່ວງເວລາສະເພາະ ສຳລັບການບໍລິການຕ່າງໆ ຫຼື ເຂົ້າພົ"
"ບ\n"
"        ການນຳທ້ອງຖິ່ນ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.homepage
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.ir_ui_view_3821
msgid ""
"Emily is a dedicated public servant who loves her work. She mentors new "
"staff and engages with community members to foster collaboration."
msgstr ""
"ເອມິລີ ເປັນພະນັກງານລັດທີ່ມີຄວາມຕັ້ງໃຈ ແລະ ຮັກໃນວຽກງານ. ລາວຄອຍໃຫ້ຄຳແນະນຳແກ່ພະນັກງານໃໝ່ ແລະ ສ້າ"
"ງສາຍພົວພັນກັບຄົນໃນຊຸມຊົນ ເພື່ອສົ່ງເສີມຄວາມສາມັກຄີ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.ir_ui_view_3821
msgid ""
"Empower your <span class=\"o_text_highlight o_translate_inline "
"o_text_highlight_freehand_1\" style=\"--text-highlight-width: 6px; --text-"
"highlight-color: var(--o-color-1);\">community</span>."
msgstr ""
