#: model_terms:blog.post,content:public_institution.blog_post_3
msgid "Living green roofs, park expansions, tree planting"
msgstr "ຫຼັງຄາສີຂຽວປູກຕົ້ນໄມ້, ການຂະຫຍາຍສວນສາທາລະນະ, ການປູກຕົ້ນໄມ້"

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:public_institution.blog_post_3
