msgstr "ທຸລະກິດທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (LocalBusiness)"

#. module: public_institution
#: model:blog.tag,name:public_institution.blog_tag_4
msgid "LocalSchools"
msgstr "ໂຮງຮຽນທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (LocalSchools)"

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:public_institution.blog_post_4
msgid "Logistics &amp; Safety:"
msgstr "ການຂົນສົ່ງ &amp; ຄວາມປອດໄພ:"

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:public_institution.blog_post_6
msgid "Love with a Panoramic View"
msgstr "ຄວາມຮັກທ່າມກາງວິວພາໂນຣາມາ"

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:public_institution.blog_post_7
msgid ""
"Marcus’s cart represents exactly what our modern City Hall plaza was built "
"for: fostering spontaneous human connection. On any given day, you will find "
"municipal clerks, construction workers, local business owners, and parents "
"fresh from the school run standing together by the wooden steps, chatting "
"over fresh pastries and lattes."
msgstr ""
"ລົດກາເຟຂອງມາກັດ ສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນເຖິງຈຸດປະສົງທີ່ແທ້ຈິງຂອງການສ້າງລານເທດສະບານແຫ່ງນີ້: ນັ້ນຄືການສ້າງສາຍສ"
"ຳພັນອັນອົບອຸ່ນລະຫວ່າງຜູ້ຄົນ. ໃນແຕ່ລະມື້, ທ່ານຈະເຫັນພະນັກງານຫ້ອງການ, ກຳມະກອນກໍ່ສ້າງ, ເຈົ້າຂອງທຸລະກິ"
"ດ, ແລະ ພໍ່ແມ່ທີ່ຫາກໍ່ໄປສົ່ງລູກ ຢືນລົມກັນຢູ່ຂັ້ນໄດໄມ້ ພ້ອມກິນເຂົ້າໜົມ ແລະ ຈິບກາເຟຢ່າງມີຄວາມສຸກ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model:project.task.type,name:public_institution.project_task_type_22
msgid "Marketing"
msgstr "ການຕະຫຼາດ"

#. module: public_institution
#: model:blog.post,name:public_institution.blog_post_5
msgid "Massive turnout for St. Mary’s primary school celebration!"
msgstr ""
"ປະຊາຊົນຫຼັ່ງໄຫຼເຂົ້າຮ່ວມງານສະເຫຼີມສະຫຼອງຂອງໂຮງຮຽນປະຖົມ ເຊນແມຣີ ຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ!"

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Maximize the use of community assets by providing a transparent online "
"booking system for halls, fields, and\n"
"        equipment."
msgstr ""
"ນຳໃຊ້ຊັບສິນຂອງຊຸມຊົນໃຫ້ເກີດປະໂຫຍດສູງສຸດ ດ້ວຍລະບົບການຈອງອອນລາຍທີ່ໂປ່ງໃສ ສຳລັບຫ້ອງປະຊຸມ, ເດີ່ນກິລ"
"າ, ແລະ\n"
"        ອຸປະກອນຕ່າງໆ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model:blog.post,name:public_institution.blog_post_1
msgid ""
"May 12th council recap: Green light for the sports field & residential "
"extension"
msgstr ""
"ສະຫຼຸບກອງປະຊຸມສະພາ 12 ພຶດສະພາ: ໄຟຂຽວອະນຸມັດໂຄງການເດີ່ນກິລາ & ຂະຫຍາຍເຂດທີ່ຢູ່ອາໄສ"

#. module: public_institution
#: model:event.event,name:public_institution.event_event_2
msgid "Mayor elections"
msgstr "ການເລືອກຕັ້ງເຈົ້າຄອງນະຄອນ"

#. module: public_institution
#: model:survey.question.answer,value:public_institution.survey_question_answer_15
msgid "Meadowview Drive (reflecting the open green space nearby)"
msgstr ""
"ຖະໜົນ ມິດໂດວິວ (Meadowview Drive) (ສະທ້ອນເຖິງພື້ນທີ່ສີຂຽວອັນກວ້າງໃຫຍ່ໃກ້ຄຽງ)"

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:public_institution.blog_post_5
msgid ""
"Meanwhile, the main lawn featured a lively fundraising lottery booth. Thanks "
"to the overwhelming generosity of local business sponsors who donated "
"prizes, the raffle ticket sales completely smashed all historical school "
"records."
msgstr ""
"ໃນຂະນະດຽວກັນ, ເດີ່ນຫຍ້າຫຼັກກໍ່ມີການອອກຮ້ານຈັບສະຫຼາກລະດົມທຶນຢ່າງຄຶກຄື້ນ. ດ້ວຍການສະໜັບສະໜູນຂອງລາງວັນຈ"
"າກບັນດາທຸລະກິດທ້ອງຖິ່ນ, ການຂາຍປີ້ຈັບສະຫຼາກສາມາດສ້າງສະຖິຕິໃໝ່ສູງສຸດເທົ່າທີ່ເຄີຍມີມາຂອງໂຮງຮຽນ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.ir_ui_view_3821
