msgstr "ພົບປະເພື່ອນບ້ານ (MeetYourNeighbor)"

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.homepage
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.ir_ui_view_3821
msgid "Michael Johnson"
msgstr "ໄມໂຄ ຈອນສັນ (Michael Johnson)"

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Modernize the way your city handles service requests by replacing physical "
"logs with a trackable digital ticketing\n"
"        system."
msgstr ""
"ຍົກລະດັບການຈັດການຄຳຮ້ອງຂອງເມືອງ ໂດຍການປ່ຽນຈາກການຈົດບັນທຶກໃນປຶ້ມ ມາເປັນລະບົບໃບແຈ້ງເລື່ອງດິຈິຕອ"
"ນ\n"
"        ທີ່ສາມາດຕິດຕາມໄດ້."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.ir_ui_view_3821
msgid ""
"Monitor all services, discover new resources, and access the right programs. "
"<br/>All this guidance and more is available at no cost."
msgstr ""
"ຕິດຕາມທຸກການບໍລິການ, ຄົ້ນຫາແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນໃໝ່, ແລະ ເຂົ້າເຖິງໂຄງການທີ່ເໝາະສົມ. <br/>ຄຳແນະນຳທັງໝົດນີ້ແມ່ນໃ"
"ຫ້ບໍລິການຟຣີ."

