#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:survey.survey,description_done:public_institution.survey_survey_1
msgid ""
"Thank you for participating in this naming survey. Your suggestions and "
"votes will be compiled and presented during the \"final review\" session of "
"the City Council next month."
msgstr ""
"ຂໍຂອບໃຈທີ່ເຂົ້າຮ່ວມການສຳຫຼວດຕັ້ງຊື່ໃນຄັ້ງນີ້. ຂໍ້ສະເໜີ ແລະ ຄະແນນສຽງຂອງທ່ານຈະຖືກຮວບຮວມເພື່ອນຳສະເໜີໃນກ"
"ອງປະຊຸມສະພາເທດສະບານໃນເດືອນໜ້າ."

