msgstr "ຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງທຸກການຕັດສິນໃຈເພື່ອຊຸມຊົນ"

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:public_institution.product_product_4_product_template
msgid ""
"Whether you are hosting a Property Owners Association (POA) general meeting "
"or a private corporate workshop, our suite provides a neutral, professional "
"environment that fosters focus and collaboration."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ວ່າທ່ານຈະຈັດກອງປະຊຸມໃຫຍ່ສະມາຄົມເຈົ້າຂອງເຮືອນ ຫຼື ສຳມະນາຂອງບໍລິສັດ, ຫ້ອງປະຊຸມຂອງພວກເຮົາມອບບັນຍາ"
"ກາດທີ່ເປັນກາງ, ເປັນມືອາຊີບ, ແລະ ສົ່ງເສີມການເຮັດວຽກຮ່ວມກັນ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model:survey.question,title:public_institution.survey_question_1
msgid ""
"Which of the following pre-selected themes resonates most with the location "
"(near the sports field and nature path)?"
msgstr ""
"ຫົວຂໍ້ໃດຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ທີ່ທ່ານເຫັນວ່າເໝາະສົມກັບສະຖານທີ່ຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດ (ໃກ້ເດີ່ນກິລາ ແລະ ເສັ້ນທາງທຳມະຊາດ)?"

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid "Would you like to discuss your Odoo setup with us or go even further?"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານຕ້ອງການປຶກສາຫາລືກ່ຽວກັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ Odoo ກັບພວກເຮົາ ຫຼື ພັດທະນາເພີ່ມເຕີມບໍ່?"

#. module: public_institution
#: model:survey.question.answer,value:public_institution.survey_question_answer_17
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "ແມ່ນ"

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You can access every installed App in your Odoo database on your main "
"dashboard."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງທຸກໆແອັບທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້ໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ Odoo ໄດ້ຈາກໜ້າກະດານຫຼັກຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.ir_ui_view_3821
msgid ""
"You can contact our support team by emailing info@youragency.example.com, "
"calling +1 555-555-5556, or using the live chat on our website. Our "
"dedicated team is available 24/7 to assist with any inquiries or concerns."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕໍ່ທີມງານຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອຂອງພວກເຮົາໄດ້ທາງອີເມວ info@youragency.example.com, ໂທລະສັບ "
"+1 555-555-5556, ຫຼື ຜ່ານລະບົບສົນທະນາສົດເທິງເວັບໄຊ. ທີມງານຂອງພວກເຮົາພ້ອມໃຫ້ບໍລິການຕະຫຼອດ 24/"
"7."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You completed that demo use case! There are millions of other ways to adapt "
"your Odoo setup to fit your\n"
"                business needs."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານໄດ້ທົດລອງກໍລະນີຕົວຢ່າງສຳເລັດແລ້ວ! ຍັງມີອີກຫຼາຍຮ້ອຍວິທີໃນການປັບແຕ່ງ Odoo ໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມກັບ\n"
"                ຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງທຸລະກິດທ່ານ."

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You didn't import demo data? You can still do it. Go to Apps &gt; Industries "
"&gt; Upgrade your package and check\n"
"                the related box"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ນຳເຂົ້າຂໍ້ມູນຕົວຢ່າງເທື່ອບໍ? ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ຕອນນີ້ ໂດຍໄປທີ່ ແອັບ (Apps) &gt; ກຸ່ມທຸລະກິ"
"ດ (Industries) &gt; ອັບເກຣດແພັກເກດຂອງທ່ານ ແລ້ວໝາຍຕິກໃສ່\n"
"                ຫ້ອງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ"

#. module: public_institution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:public_institution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You should be able to execute the following flows to have an overview of "
